.TH CLAMPF 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
clampf \- Limit v to the range lo..hi
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqmathx.h\(dq
.BI "float clampf(float v, float lo, float hi);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Limit v to the range lo..hi. Keeping a position inside the world, health inside 0..max, a menu index inside its list.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
lo if v < lo, hi if v > hi, else v.
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/mathx.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR clampi (3),
.BR minf (3),
.BR maxf (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
